        <mxCell id="s3controlb" parent="cuq56whP_faNey6bLfMv-6" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=3;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontColor=#26374B;fontStyle=0;" value="Source: cstuhub-private-documents-781485979426-ap-southeast-1&lt;br&gt;Versioning + 3 lifecycle rules; staging current/old 1 day,&lt;br&gt;ready noncurrent 90 days per repo config; ready current retained.&lt;br&gt;Backup: versioning, Block Public Access, SSE-S3, owner enforced.&lt;br&gt;5 old current objects copied manually (4 PDF + 1 PNG), not all versions.&lt;br&gt;Replica COMPLETED verified; app restore / version mapping untested." vertex="1">
