        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cuq56whP_faNey6bLfMv-28" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(104, 126, 145); font-family: Arial; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;05 / AVAILABILITY, SECURITY &amp;amp; NETWORK DECISIONS — คำอธิบายสำหรับนำเสนอ&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="32" width="780" x="80" y="3640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cuq56whP_faNey6bLfMv-24" connectable="0" parent="1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="338" width="490" x="120" y="3710" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hat" parent="cuq56whP_faNey6bLfMv-24" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=3;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontColor=#26374B;fontStyle=1;" value="AVAILABILITY" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hab" parent="cuq56whP_faNey6bLfMv-24" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=3;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#26374B;fontStyle=0;" value="AWS-managed resilience&lt;br&gt;• Lambda รันอยู่บนหลาย AZ อยู่เเล้ว&lt;br&gt;• DynamoDB มีการทำสำเนาข้อมูลข้าม AZ โดย AWS อยู่เเล้ว.&lt;br&gt;• S3 Standard กระจายข้อมูลอย่างน้อย 3 AZ อยู่เเล้ว.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;PITR 35 วันทั้ง 6 ตาราง [AUDIT]&lt;br&gt;เปิด 29 ต.ค.; หน้าต่างย้อนหลังเพิ่มตามเวลาที่เปิด.&lt;br&gt;Restore สร้างตารางใหม่ ไม่แทนที่ตารางเดิมทันที.&lt;br&gt;ต้องปรับ environment / IAM / metadata แล้วตรวจระบบ." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="212" width="490" y="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cuq56whP_faNey6bLfMv-25" connectable="0" parent="1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="358" width="520" x="640" y="3710" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="securityt" parent="cuq56whP_faNey6bLfMv-25" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=3;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontColor=#26374B;fontStyle=1;" value="SECURITY" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="securityb" parent="cuq56whP_faNey6bLfMv-25" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=3;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#26374B;fontStyle=0;" value="Browser → app: HTTPS + opaque session [CODE]&lt;br&gt;Secure / HttpOnly / SameSite=Lax; idle 30m / max 8h.&lt;br&gt;Backend: role / scope / parent / participant checks;&lt;br&gt;UI hiding is not authorization. Public fields filtered.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;AWS: execution role จำกัด resource/action;&lt;br&gt;DynamoDB ConditionCheck + app version checks.&lt;br&gt;S3: private bucket + TLS-only + CORS origin [CODE]&lt;br&gt;CORS is not authentication; signed URL is a temporary grant.&lt;br&gt;Replication role trusts S3, limited ready prefixes [AUDIT].&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SCP เปิด Singapore เฉพาะบัญชีเว็บ [deployment note].&lt;br&gt;SCP ไม่ให้สิทธิ์เว็บ user และไม่แทน IAM allow." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="320" width="520" y="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cuq56whP_faNey6bLfMv-26" connectable="0" parent="1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="480" x="1200" y="3710" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scalet" parent="cuq56whP_faNey6bLfMv-26" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=3;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontColor=#26374B;fontStyle=1;" value="SCALE / COST / BOTTLENECKS" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scaleb" parent="cuq56whP_faNey6bLfMv-26" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=3;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#26374B;fontStyle=0;" value="DynamoDB: On-demand&lt;br&gt;Lambda Auth: shared unreserved pool 400;&lt;br&gt;provisioned concurrency 0 [AUDIT] (ไม่ใช่ 400 users).&lt;br&gt;API account: rate 10,000/s, burst 5,000;&lt;br&gt;stage custom throttle not configured;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Public catalog scans whole Partner table.&lt;br&gt;Data growth increases read work / latency / cost.&lt;br&gt;Direct S3 upload avoids proxying file payload via API." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="212" width="480" y="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="recovert" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=3;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontColor=#26374B;fontStyle=1;" value="RECOVERY" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="430" x="1720" y="3710" as="geometry" />
